# ============================================================
# v10.0.96 - LIVE SUNDAY/MONDAY GAP-WATCH OVERRIDE
# ============================================================
# Agreed live behaviour:
# - do not let a normal Sunday/Monday gap-driven RED/CRITICAL state mechanically
#   trim/close the basket;
# - hold existing trades and block NEW stacking while the active basket is in the
#   gap-watch window;
# - keep the normal individual hard emergency SL live;
# - allow normal basket defence again only when damage is genuinely severe;
# - freeze NEW managed-stop tightening during the window, but never loosen/remove
#   an already-existing OANDA stop;
# - research 2.0%/2.5% temporary hard-SL alternatives without changing live SLs.
